Hello,

I would like to announce my candidacy for the PTL of the OpenStack Sunbeam
project for the 2027.1 cycle.

I've been a core team member of the OpenStack Sunbeam project since the
incubation stage. I've contributed to most of the charms producing new
features, new charms, enabling CI, bug fixes. Previously, I have been ptl
for 2024.2, 2025.2 cycles.

My goal in this cycle is
* to improve CI/CD pipelines to make them more reliable and faster
* Prioritize the bugs and plan for early fixes of critical and high
priority bugs

Best Regards,
